[node name="Camera2D" type="Camera2D" parent="."]
; The one place the gameplay zoom is set, for phone and PC alike. 0.85 shows about seventeen 48px
; cells across a phone in portrait, roughly what Vampire Survivors shows; a PC's 1280x720 landscape
; canvas at the same zoom shows about the same area of ground, so the two play alike. It was 1.25,
; and on a phone the swarm arrived before it could be read. Node2DGame reads it back out to keep
; the spawn ring and the tiled ground shader in step.
zoom = Vector2(0.85, 0.85)

